            <span class="text-xs pb-2" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs mb-1 plan-term" data-six="6-month minimum" data-annual="12-month minimum" data-rolling="Cancel anytime (30 days notice)" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">6-month minimum</p>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold mb-5 plan-save hidden annual-badge" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Save £100 on setup + £168 over year</p>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold mb-5 plan-save hidden rolling-badge" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Flexible, no commitment</p>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold mb-5 plan-save six-badge" style="color:#2ECC9A;">Nothing to pay until live</p>

          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-1 mb-6">
